<title>USA: Primary Bank declares 5 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Primary Bank declares 5 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>PETERBOROUGH, N.H. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primary Bank said on Friday it has declared a five percent stock dividend to shareholders of record as of January 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be paid out on January 20. One common share will be issued for every 20 shares owned, the company said. Fractional shares are to be paid in cash.</p>
<p>&quot;The decision to issue this stock dividend reflects the bank's desire to improve the marketability and liquidity of the stock,&quot; Primary Bank President and Chief Executive Christopher Flynn said in a statement.</p>
</text>
